# Every text file is checked out with LF, as it's stored, on every OS. Git for Windows (and GitHub's Windows
# runners) default to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites text files to CRLF on checkout. Bytes matter here:
# factory presets name their captures by a hash of the file (content/models/*/gainset.json), and tests compare
# against golden files. Binary files (WAVs, fonts, images) are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
